 "operationalization": {
  "rules": [
   "baseline: bare 1h CISD (series_open, 2/2 swing, max_wait 3), decide at the confirming bar's close, enter next M1 open, stop at the protected swing, 2R, 10h max hold",
   "reads = previous-candle closure class of the last completed 18:00-NY trading day before the CISD bar's day",
   "universe = prior reading a's gated arm: dollar = -(EURUSD read) directional, trade opposite the dollar, XAU/XAG line daily read directional AND equal to the trade direction (the cross selects gold)",
   "EQ = 0.5 of the cross day's full range on the XAU/XAG hourly-close line: (max + min hourly ratio close) / 2",
   "gate (hold): every XAU/XAG hourly close ending after the cross day closed and at/before the decision stays on the read's side of EQ (bearish read: <= EQ, bullish: >= EQ); complement: a close through EQ already invalidated the read; rows with no hourly ratio close in the window dropped",
   "control holds the NY clock (ctrl_tod_tol_min 30)"
  ],
